Device configuration for the LGE LU5400 (LG Prada 3.0)

Proprietary blobs
-----------------

proprietary-files.txt is the canonical blob manifest. Each entry uses:

    system/relative/path|sha1

Extract the known-good blobs from a connected, booted device:

    device/lge/p940/extract-files.sh

Alternatively, extract them from an unpacked system directory:

    device/lge/p940/extract-files.sh /path/to/system

All 55 files are staged and checked before vendor/lge/p940/proprietary is
replaced. A missing file or SHA-1 mismatch aborts extraction and preserves the
existing vendor tree. setup-makefiles.sh regenerates the vendor makefiles from
the same manifest without copying or storing the proprietary files in git.
